# Email Verification Implementation

This plan outlines the steps to implement email verification across the SPARK Student Network. To prevent fake accounts, users must verify their email before they can access the platform.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The backend `package.json` does not currently list `nodemailer`. I will run `npm install nodemailer` as part of this plan. 

> [!NOTE]
> Since we do not have a production SMTP server set up yet, I will use `nodemailer` with [Ethereal Email](https://ethereal.email/) for development, which captures outgoing emails and logs a preview URL to the console. You can specify production SMTP credentials in `.env` later.

