### Backend Controllers & Routes

#### [MODIFY] [authController.js](file:///c:/Users/MAHARSHI/Downloads/SPARK/src/controllers/authController.js)
- **`register`**: Generate a 32-byte hex token, set expiration to 24h. Call `sendVerificationEmail`. Remove automatic login (do not return JWT).
- **`login`**: Check if `is_email_verified` is true. If not, return `403 Forbidden` with a message.
- **[NEW] `verifyEmail`**: Look up the token, mark `is_email_verified = true`, and clear the token fields.
- **[NEW] `resendVerification`**: Generate a new token and trigger `sendVerificationEmail` for an unverified user.

