## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- No automated tests currently exist, but I will verify build integrity (`npm run build`).

### Manual Verification
- Start the server.
- Register a new user and observe the Ethereal email preview URL logged in the backend terminal.
- Attempt to log in with the unverified user (should be blocked with a 403).
- Open the verify link in the browser, triggering the verification process.
- Log in successfully after verification.
